data.text:
I found the smoking gun:
I see the issue clearly now. The current webview.css is forcing everything to 14px with medium weight, which flattens the hierarchy and makes bold/strong look identical to normal text. That's why the Claude-style rendering feels off.

The best fix is to append a high-specificity override block at the end of webview.css that targets the markdown component directly. This way it survives extension updates better than patching the middle of the file.

Here's what I recommend:

```css
/* kilo-claude-markdown-override */
[data-component=markdown] {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.

input.content:
/* === kilo-claude-md-start === */
[data-component="markdown"] {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

[data-component="markdown"] h1,
[data-component="markdown"] h2,
[data-component="markdown"] h3,
[data-component="markdown"] h4,
[data-component="markdown"] h5,
[data-component="markdown"] h6 {
  color: var(--text-strong);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.35;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin-top: 1.15em;
  margin-bottom: 0.4em;
}

[data-component="markdown"] h1 { font-size: 1.375rem; }
[data-component="markdown"] h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; }
[data-component="markdown"] h3 { font-size: 1rem; }
[data-component="markdown"] h4,
[data-component="markdown"] h5,
[data-component="markdown"] h6 { font-size: 0.95rem; }

[data-component="markdown"] p {
  margin-top: 0;
  margin-bottom: 0.85em;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

[data-component="markdown"] strong,
[data-component="markdown"] b {
  color: var(--text-strong);
  font-weight: 700;
}

[data-component="markdown"] ul,
[data-component="markdown"] ol {
  margin-top: 0.45em;
  margin-bottom: 0.9em;
  padding-inline-start: 2rem;
}

[data-component="markdown"] li {
  margin-bottom: 0.4em;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

[data-component="markdown"] li > p:first-child {
  display: block;
  margin: 0;
}

[data-component="markdown"] li > p + p {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.45em;
}

[data-component="markdown"] table {
  font-size: 0.9em;
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin: 0.7em 0 1.1em;
  border-collapse: collapse;
}

[data-component="markdown"] th {
  font-weight: 700;
}

[data-component="markdown"] th,
[data-component="markdown"] td {
  padding: 0.45em 0.85em 0.45em 0;
  vertical-align: top;
}

[data-component="markdown"] blockquote {
  margin: 0.9em 0;
  padding-inline-start: 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

[data-component="markdown"] hr {
  margin: 1.5em 0;
}

.message-list {
  padding: 16px 36px 20px 24px;
}
/* === kilo-claude-md-end === */

